XRP-DEMAND-20261030","claim":"SBI's Open Standard relationship with Coinbase and its broader multi-rail activity create incremental XRP demand.","supporting_source_ids":["SRC-SBI-OPENSTANDARD-JPYSC-OUSD-20261016","SRC-SBI-RLUSD-USDC-DISTRIBUTION-20260624","SRC-SBI-RIPPLE-ASIA-AWAJ-XRPL-20260220"],"counterevidence":"The JPYSC/OUSD PoC is only being considered; JPYSC is not publicly transferable; Circle Arc and OUSD can operate without native XRP; RLUSD/USDC distribution does not require XRP as bridge. No XRP purchases or settlement volumes are disclosed.","status":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},{"hypothesis_id":"HYP-SBI-BITBANK-XRP-LIQUIDITY-CONSOLIDATION-20261030","claim":"SBI's completed Bitbank acquisition could consolidate Japanese XRP liquidity and market access across SBI-controlled venues.","supporting_source_ids":["SRC-SBI-BITBANK-ACQUISITION-COMPLETE-20261001"],"counterevidence":"No shared order book, merged custody, common market-making inventory, post-acquisition XRP market share or transfer series has been verified.","status":"SPECULATIVE"}],"source_ids":["SRC-SBI-JPYSC-ISSUER-RESERVES-20260930-CAPTURE-20261030","SRC-SBI-JPYSC-VC-TRADE-TRANSFER-STATUS-20261030","SRC-SBI-VC-TRADE-CUSTODY-GROWTH-RANKING-202609-20261027","SRC-SBI-JPYSC-JGB-RESERVES-20260907","SRC-SBI-SMFG-JPYSC-CAPITAL-ALLIANCE-20261030","SRC-SBI-OPENSTANDARD-JPYSC-OUSD-20261016","SRC-SBI-BLACKROCK-JPYSC-TOKENIZED-MMF-MOU-20261027","SRC-SBI-RLUSD-USDC-DISTRIBUTION-20260624","SRC-SBI-BITBANK-ACQUISITION-COMPLETE-20261001","SRC-SBI-CIRCLE-IPO-INVESTMENT-RECHECK-20261030","SRC-SBI-CIRCLE-JV-50-50-PRESENTATION-RECHECK-20261030","SRC-CIRCLE-ARC-MAINNET-LAUNCH-20260916","SRC-SBI-RIPPLE-ASIA-AWAJ-XRPL-20260220","SRC-SBI-RIPPLE-ASIA-OWNERSHIP-60-40-PRESENTATION-20250207","SRC-SBI-VISA-CRYPTO-CARD-XRP-20260501","SRC-SBI-START-BOND-XRP-REWARD-SOLD-OUT-20261030","SRC-CIRCLE-USDC-XRPL-NATIVE-RECHECK-20261030","SRC-COINBASE-Q3-2026-EARNINGS-DECK-20261030","SRC-COINDESK-OPENSTANDARD-RIPPLE-PARTNER-20260630","SRC-SBI-TRUST-MERGER-20261029","SRC-SBI-JPYSC-ACCOUNT-BOUND-LAUNCH-20260624","SRC-SBI-CIRCLE-JV-ESTABLISHMENT-RECHECK-20261030","SRC-SBICAH-SBI-CRYPTO-ASSET-HOLDINGS-20230214"],"limitations":["JPYSC's current SBI VC Trade service does not support customer deposits or withdrawals; public-chain circulation remains conditional. Do not use projected public-chain functionality as observed volume.","The JPYSC issuer page reports balances as of 2026-09-30. A secondary report of approximately JPY20.8B on 30 October has not been independently confirmed by a current primary issuer balance.","The approximately JPY6.9B JPYSC Lending figure is applications/program activity, not additional issued supply and not a verified outstanding loan balance.","The legal 50% investment allowance applies only to qualifying short-term government bonds/time deposits subject to requirements. The public page does not disclose all time-deposit maturities or a complete compliance calculation.","The 5% SMFG participation and BlackRock/Open Standard agreements are research, MOU or PoC-stage relationships; no production volume is established.","Circle SBI Japan K.K. (Circle/SBI JV), SBI Startale Marketing (SBI/Startale JV), SBI Ripple Asia, SBI VC Trade, SBI Shinsei Trust, SBI Holdings, SBIC East Japan and SBICAH GK are distinct entities. Do not conflate them.","SBI's multi-rail relationships do not prove XRP demand. JPYSC/OUSD, USDC, RLUSD and Circle Arc can operate without native XRP as a bridge asset; no measured incremental XRP purchase or settlement flow is identified.","SBI's completed Bitbank acquisition does not establish shared order books, merged custody, common market-making inventory or consolidated XRP liquidity with SBI VC Trade.","The approximately 9% SBI Ripple equity holding is historical as of June 2025 and is not a verified current ownership percentage."],"forecast_status":"NOT_ISSUED","market_features_admitted":false}